  "question": "1. Background / Context\nBalanced Tree Clothing Company specializes in providing a curated selection of clothing and lifestyle wear aimed at modern adventurers. To better understand its sales performance, the company's merchandising team requires assistance in analyzing data and generating a financial report that can be shared across the organization.\n\n 2. Objectives\nThe objective of this project is to develop a system that enables the analysis of sales data and the production of a basic financial report for Balanced Tree Clothing Company.\n\n 3. Stakeholders & Users\n- Stakeholders: \n  - Danny (CEO)\n  - Merchandising Team\n- Users:\n  - Data Analysts\n  - Financial Team\n\n 4. Functional Descriptions\n- Utilize the available sales and product data to analyze sales performance.\n- Generate a financial report using the data from the two main tables: `product_details` and `sales`.\n- Process additional data from `product_hierarchy` and `product_prices` for advanced queries and insights (bonus challenges).\n\n 5. Non-Functional Descriptions\n- Ensure data accuracy and integrity when processing and generating reports.\n- The system should be scalable to handle an increase in data volume as the company grows.\n- The reports must be generated in a timely manner to support business decisions.",
  "ddl": "-- Schema for database: schemabench_0199\nCREATE TABLE `product_hierarchy` (\n  `product_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `product_name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `category_id` int(11) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `segment_id` int(11) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `style_id` int(11) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `category_name` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `segment_name` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `style_name` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`product_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `product_details` (\n  `product_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `product_name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `segment_name` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `category_name` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `style_name` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `product_description` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`product_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `product_prices` (\n  `product_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `price` decimal(10,2) NOT NULL,\n  `start_date` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `end_date` datetime DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`product_id`,`start_date`),\n  CONSTRAINT `product_prices_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`product_id`) REFERENCES `product_details` (`product_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `sales` (\n  `sale_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `sale_date` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `product_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `customer_id` int(11) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `quantity` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `price` decimal(10,2) NOT NULL,\n  `discount` decimal(5,2) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `revenue` decimal(12,2) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`sale_id`),\n  KEY `sales_ibfk_1` (`product_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `sales_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`product_id`) REFERENCES `product_details` (`product_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;",
